1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,640
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:12,870 --> 00:01:13,480
Coming through.

4
00:01:16,350 --> 00:01:16,710
Captain.

5
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:17,070
Mm.

6
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:17,920
Tell them to stop filming.

7
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:26,560
Coming.

8
00:01:26,870 --> 00:01:27,510
What's the situation?

9
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,400
Another one.

10
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:31,760
He was found wearing women's underwear.

11
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,760
Multiple stab wounds.

12
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:34,310
What was the fatal wound?

13
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:36,560
Mm.

14
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:38,120
Ruptured internal organs.

15
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,790
There was an umbrella in the car.

16
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,760
The killer used it
to assault him anally.

17
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,760
How much must the killer have hated him?

18
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,710
Fang Xin, bring back all surveillance
footage from the area.

19
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:50,000
Expand the canvass.

20
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,510
See if there were any witnesses.

21
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:28,750
Han Ning.

22
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:38,430
The killer lured Xu Haodong here
while he was drunk.

23
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:39,710
After he parked,

24
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:41,560
she subdued him with a stun gun.

25
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,000
Then she touched up her makeup.

26
00:02:44,590 --> 00:02:48,310
Then she humiliated and tortured him
until he died.

27
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:50,870
What about the method?

28
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,520
Almost identical to the Zou Jun case.

29
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:56,430
In both cases, the killer targeted
male anatomy.

30
00:02:58,310 --> 00:03:00,680
Xu Haodong and Zou Jun shared a secret.

31
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,240
Look into what they have in common.

32
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,080
Let's link the cases.

33
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,870
My biggest fear is

34
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,560
another victim.

35
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,360
Captain Ren, we have an update
from the traffic division.

36
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:13,520
The car belongs to Xu Haodong.

37
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,960
Before the murder, it was parked
in Tianma Nightclub's parking lot.

38
00:03:17,870 --> 00:03:18,240
Master.

39
00:03:18,710 --> 00:03:19,470
You know that place.

40
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:20,520
Take Han Ning there to have a look.

41
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,080
Sure.

42
00:03:21,470 --> 00:03:21,710
Let's go.

43
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:33,240
According to the records,

44
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:37,560
both Zou Jun and Xu Haodong
have criminal records.

45
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:39,430
Go on.

46
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:44,630
Zou Jun was arrested
for procuring women for prostitution.

47
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:46,840
And Xu Haodong?

48
00:03:47,150 --> 00:03:50,120
He unlawfully confined a woman
and injured her.

49
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,280
You think the two cases are connected?

50
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:57,590
The killer may have been a victim
in one of their old cases.

51
00:03:58,870 --> 00:03:59,840
Very likely.

52
00:04:00,150 --> 00:04:01,310
Gao Yuan is already looking into it.

53
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:05,240
I reviewed their statements
from seven years ago.

54
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:06,870
They both mentioned the same place.

55
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,240
What place?

56
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,310
Night Flight Club.

57
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:17,830
You found that so quickly.

58
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:20,510
You also think the seven-year-old case

59
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:21,600
is connected to this one?

60
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,560
The Cuiping Mountain Road case.

61
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:28,000
I've always wanted to reopen it.

62
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,430
But without solid new evidence,

63
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:33,950
the higher-ups won't approve it.

64
00:04:33,950 --> 00:04:34,600
That's protocol.

65
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,680
As for the relevant leads,

66
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:41,360
I exhausted them all seven years ago.

67
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:47,680
Because of my sister's case,

68
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,870
you've remained an ordinary detective
all these years.

69
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,510
Back when I was in school,

70
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:54,720
you kept it from me to protect me.

71
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,950
But now I'm a sworn police officer

72
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,600
who can stand on my own.

73
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:05,950
I know.

74
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,430
I know.

75
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:20,630
Sorry, gentlemen.

76
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,000
Yes?

77
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,310
We're not open yet.

78
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:24,510
We need to ask your manager
a few questions.

79
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:28,510
Okay.

80
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:29,830
Could you wait a moment?

81
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:47,560
Playing hide-and-seek?

82
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:49,800
Who are you?

83
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:52,000
Do you work for Er Lvzi,

84
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,160
or Xiaoguang?

85
00:05:53,870 --> 00:05:55,040
I don't know what you mean.

86
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:55,680
Move.

87
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,750
You've heard of He Shouhei, right?

88
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:03,870
Oh, so you're Uncle He.

89
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,950
Brother Guang mentions you all the time.

90
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,160
My apologies.

91
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,310
You were with Xu Haodong last night.

92
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,120
Why are you looking at me?

93
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,000
I wasn't the one who went with him.

94
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,720
Tell the truth.

95
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,680
It was me.

96
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:17,480
Did you go with him?

97
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:18,830
No.

98
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,390
If you did, just say so.

99
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:23,270
Tell the truth.

100
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:24,190
I really didn't.

101
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:25,360
He was the one

102
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,120
meant to take me away yesterday.

103
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,240
But just as we were leaving,

104
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,310
a waitress slipped me 5,000 yuan.

105
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:32,630
She said she'd go in my place.

106
00:06:33,510 --> 00:06:35,360
Then she told me to tell Mr. Xu

107
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,560
that I had my period.

108
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,190
What's her name?

109
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,270
Her name was Lili.

110
00:06:39,870 --> 00:06:41,720
The quiet one, right?

111
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,360
What was her name again?

112
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:44,950
Let me see.

113
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:48,750
Li Xiaoli.

114
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:49,870
Right.

115
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,600
That's her.

116
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,630
What about Xu Haodong?

117
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:01,240
He ended up leaving
with a waitress from the nightclub.

118
00:07:01,830 --> 00:07:03,040
We checked all the employment forms.

119
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,120
All the information was fake.

120
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:06,390
The woman had worked there
for less than half a month.

121
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:07,430
She hadn't even collected a paycheck

122
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,310
or gotten close to anyone.

123
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:11,240
That's the footage
we retrieved yesterday.

124
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:14,390
We compared surveillance footage
near both crime scenes.

125
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:16,190
It's most likely the same woman.

126
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:20,040
But besides her,

127
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,070
there was another man.

128
00:07:21,750 --> 00:07:23,870
He appeared near both crime scenes.

129
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:30,270
That's far too much of a coincidence.

130
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,560
Find out who he is.

131
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,390
Yes.

132
00:07:41,510 --> 00:07:42,870
Ma'am, how does it look?

133
00:07:45,950 --> 00:07:48,070
Why did you cut it so unevenly?

134
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,950
Didn't I tell you how I wanted it?

135
00:07:49,950 --> 00:07:51,040
And you still cut it like this?

136
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,310
I...

137
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:52,190
Do it again.

138
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,390
It has to be redone.

139
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:55,600
I'm sorry, ma'am.

140
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,310
I'm sorry.

141
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,870
I'll have it redone for you.

142
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:01,560
Please don't be upset.

143
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,560
Kevin, come over and fix her haircut.

144
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,040
You, come here.

145
00:08:21,070 --> 00:08:23,360
Xiao Jiang, how many times
has this happened?

146
00:08:24,510 --> 00:08:25,510
Sorry, boss.

147
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,310
Save it.

148
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,390
Pack your things.

149
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,070
Get out.

150
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,270
One more chance. I promise...

151
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:32,390
Not a chance.

152
00:08:32,790 --> 00:08:34,150
I told you to sell memberships,
but you refused.

153
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:36,200
You can't remember
a word of the sales pitch.

154
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,600
I let all that slide.

155
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,720
But customers are constantly
complaining about you.

156
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,030
How can I keep this shop open?

157
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,510
They don't know
what hairstyles suit them.

158
00:08:43,510 --> 00:08:45,240
And you call yourself a trained stylist?

159
00:08:45,550 --> 00:08:45,750
Huh?

160
00:08:46,270 --> 00:08:47,120
The customer is always right.

161
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:48,870
You do whatever the customer asks.

162
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:50,000
Don't you get that?

163
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,120
Can't you read the room?

164
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,720
No wonder nobody likes you.

165
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,120
You're useless.

166
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,720
Boss, someone's here to see him.

167
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,200
Who?

168
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:58,080
The police.

169
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:07,670
Name.

170
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,000
Jiang Li.

171
00:09:09,390 --> 00:09:09,790
Age.

172
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:10,790
Twenty-two.

173
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,720
At 9:30 p.m. the night before last,

174
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:16,390
what were you doing near Huayang Road?

175
00:09:17,270 --> 00:09:18,000
The night before last?

176
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:21,440
The shop was quiet, so I left work.

177
00:09:22,150 --> 00:09:23,480
I live in Qidong Garden.

178
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:25,270
Huayang Road is on my way home.

179
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,240
Why did you enter the club?

180
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,200
How long did you stay?

181
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,790
A little over ten minutes.

182
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,390
I just went in to use the restroom.

183
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:34,870
It was huge inside.

184
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,360
I almost got lost.

185
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:43,150
What were you doing at Zhisheng Tower
after 10 p.m. Monday?

186
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,150
Monday?

187
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,240
Our water heater had broken down.

188
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,480
I called a repairman.

189
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,390
He said he couldn't fix it.

190
00:09:50,390 --> 00:09:51,440
It needed replacing.

191
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,120
So I went to talk to my landlord.

192
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:55,720
But he kept refusing to pay.

193
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:56,670
I had no choice.

194
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:58,120
So I showered at a coworker's place,

195
00:09:58,550 --> 00:10:00,000
and stayed there that night.

196
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,080
He can vouch for me.

197
00:10:06,790 --> 00:10:07,440
This woman...

198
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:08,630
Does her figure

199
00:10:09,030 --> 00:10:09,790
look familiar?

200
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,000
Think carefully.

201
00:10:15,150 --> 00:10:15,720
I don't know her.

202
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:50,960
The anti-vice and anti-gang crackdown
seven years ago

203
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,550
was a multi-agency operation.

204
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:53,870
Uncle He took part too.

205
00:10:55,150 --> 00:10:56,630
According to the file,

206
00:10:56,790 --> 00:10:59,360
the people arrested with Zou Jun

207
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:01,600
besides Xu Haodong were these men.

208
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,030
If the killer's motive is revenge,

209
00:11:04,150 --> 00:11:05,440
the next target

210
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,360
is likely one of them.

211
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,550
I'm getting old.

212
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:14,670
My memory's slipping.

213
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,200
But I should be able
to recognize them from photos.

214
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,720
I don't know this one.

215
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:26,960
He died in a car crash
after his release.

216
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,200
I don't remember this one either.

217
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:31,630
This one became a real estate agent

218
00:11:31,630 --> 00:11:33,960
in the college town after his release.

219
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:35,390
This one suffered a cerebral hemorrhage

220
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:39,240
soon after being imprisoned.

221
00:11:39,750 --> 00:11:40,840
I remember this one well.

222
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:43,790
After his release, he committed another
home invasion and went back to prison.

223
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:46,550
This one now works as an auto mechanic.

224
00:11:50,550 --> 00:11:53,840
I think we should investigate
these three carefully.

225
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:55,360
Okay.

226
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:03,880
[Yu Hongfei, Wang Liqiang, Chen Lin]

227
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,790
Speak.

228
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,510
Zou Jun and Xu Haodong are both dead.

229
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:33,240
Did you know?

230
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:34,600
Yeah.

231
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,840
Da Fei seems to be in someone's sights.

232
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,750
I fear someone's digging up the past.

233
00:12:39,390 --> 00:12:40,200
Can you help me?

234
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,080
I'm tied up.

235
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:42,720
No time.

236
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:37,340
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

237
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:39,280
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

238
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:41,190
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

239
00:13:41,190 --> 00:13:43,000
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

240
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,330
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

241
00:13:45,330 --> 00:13:47,760
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

242
00:13:50,900 --> 00:13:52,810
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

243
00:13:52,810 --> 00:13:54,710
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

244
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:56,650
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

245
00:13:56,650 --> 00:13:58,780
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

246
00:13:58,810 --> 00:14:00,790
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

247
00:14:00,790 --> 00:14:02,950
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

248
00:14:06,540 --> 00:14:10,020
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

249
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:13,390
♪Why is that child crying?♪

250
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:16,090
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

251
00:14:16,090 --> 00:14:17,710
♪Means I've grown up♪

252
00:14:17,710 --> 00:14:20,860
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

253
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:24,340
♪The wound still aches♪

254
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:29,100
♪Like a biting winter♪

255
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:32,370
♪But a spark still glows♪

